  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v6.4.0: Adds optional IRetrievalEmbeddingProvider and immutable EmbeddingDocument for document/query-aware embeddings with complete ordered document chunks. Existing IEmbeddingProvider signatures remain unchanged. Documents vector ownership, count/dimension/finite-value requirements, cancellation and provider-owned request batching without silent contextual splitting. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v640",
